# Self-hosted Python runtime (~13 MB of WebAssembly binaries).
# Fetched on demand with `npm run fetch:pyodide` rather than committed — git
# would keep them for the life of the repository. The build FAILS if
# VITE_PYODIDE_URL points here and they are absent, so a deploy cannot
# silently fall back to a CDN that a school network blocks.
public/pyodide/

# Monaco editor, copied from node_modules by `npm run fetch:monaco`.
# A ~15 MB build artifact, not source — regenerated in CI and on deploy.
public/monaco/
